      "raw": "<p>So, played my first game with Unity. She&#39;s a lot of fun, but I had a question on how her golems work with damage buffs. For example, when agent adept plays his song to add 1 dmg to a target, each golem would count&nbsp;as a target, correct? I can&#39;t add that dmg to unity and up all the golems&#39; dmg because they&#39;re dealing it, not her. If I wanted to up their&nbsp;dmg, I would have to choose two of them. That makes the most sense to keep her balance. How does that work with someone like Legacy who just does a blanket +1 to all heroes? I&#39;m guess it just doesn&#39;t apply to golems, correct? Instead, it would only apply to her cards that say, &quot;Unity deals....&quot; Does she just not really synergize well with Legacy then?</p>",
