      "created_at": "2012-09-27T08:52:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the Enhanced Edition, Galvanise (and Inspiring Presence)&nbsp;refers to hero targets rather than heroes so yes, it does work with Unity's golems and she synergises incredibly well with Legacy. Champion Bot adds to that so Unity and Legacy can put out even more frightening damage than Unity on her own.</p>",
